{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39716","headline":"赠宿松杨明府 · 黄滔","name":"赠宿松杨明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪上家家礼乐新，始知爲政异常伦。\n若非似水清无底，争得如冰凛拂人。\n月狖声和琴调咽，烟村景接柳条春。\n宦游兼得逍遥趣，休忆三吴旧钓津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}